---
description: Always use --no-pager when calling git commands.
globs: 
alwaysApply: true
---

# You are not great at handling paginated output.

- When running any git command, always include --no-pager as the first parameter - before the actual git command you want to perform.
- For example: `git --no-pager diff` or `git --no-pager log` or `git --no-pager status`